  "section_05": {
    "visible": true,
    "text_001": "LOOSE NOTES / THINGS WORTH KEEPING IN VIEW",
    "text_002": "A few thoughts",
    "text_003": "pinned to the wall.",
    "text_004": "Open a note to see the thinking underneath.",
    "text_005": "QUESTION / 01",
    "text_006": "What are we",
    "text_007": "actually solving?",
    "text_008": "+",
    "text_009": "A deliverable is a thing we make. The brief should also explain what it needs to change for the person using it.",
    "text_010": "REMINDER / 02",
    "text_011": "Someone needs",
    "text_012": "to own the",
    "text_013": "next move.",
    "text_014": "+",
    "text_015": "Give each action a clear owner, an expected output, and the context needed to begin. Shared effort still needs clear responsibility.",
    "text_016": "WORKING THOUGHT / 03",
    "text_017": "Feedback needs",
    "text_018": "a landing place.",
    "text_019": "+",
    "text_020": "Bring comments back to the same version of the work. Resolve conflicting direction before asking the team to execute.",
    "text_021": "DON’T FORGET / 04",
    "text_022": "Leave the next",
    "text_023": "person ready.",
    "text_024": "+",
    "text_025": "A useful handover answers three questions: where are the files, what is still open, and who owns the next step?"
  },
